abstract: "Drafting layer: specifications that translate human and institutional intent into behavior across legal, organizational and technical interpreters, with the eight-element anatomy, interpreter map, hostile-case checklist, proof-carrying analysis record, two expositions (machine-readable rules, earned enforcement), four templates and a worked example."
